{"2844360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mischief", "steam_appid": 2844360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of brave, mischievous rats in Mischief, the full action-adventure experience from Tavern Rat Studios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant neighborhood from a rat’s-eye view as you scurry, scamper, and scheme your way through creative co-op challenges, zany minigames, and unforgettable boss battles. Designed for couch co-op chaos and heartfelt fun, Mischief reimagines classic multiplayer adventures for a new generation.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/04c6ee4257e47efdfeb87ad82574712e.poster.avif?t=1755194545\" width=600 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/04c6ee4257e47efdfeb87ad82574712e.webm?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/04c6ee4257e47efdfeb87ad82574712e.mp4?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> Chaotic Co-op Adventures</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to four local players and dive into an imaginative world brimming with charm and challenge.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against larger-than-life household bosses like Shovul, Scourge of the Sandbox and Oscar, Pup of the Pit.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use everyday objects like crayons, ketchup, and surge protectors in clever ways to overcome obstacles and prank your foes. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/ef45457ec0ce530c23e02e0358e0c01b.poster.avif?t=1755194545\" width=600 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/ef45457ec0ce530c23e02e0358e0c01b.webm?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/ef45457ec0ce530c23e02e0358e0c01b.mp4?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> Competitive PvP Minigames</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break from teamwork and compete head-to-head in a variety of fast-paced minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your reflexes in a zany shooting gallery where precision is key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race your friends on chaotic, obstacle-filled rat tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outmaneuver rivals in a platforming showdown where only one rat can reign supreme.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more games to unlock and master!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/d7c90dbf5ec1416169c4018ab322b822.poster.avif?t=1755194545\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/d7c90dbf5ec1416169c4018ab322b822.webm?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/d7c90dbf5ec1416169c4018ab322b822.mp4?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A <strong>World of Whimsy and Wonder</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore richly detailed environments built from everyday objects, viewed through the eyes of a rat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve co-op puzzles that require communication and creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and celebrate your wins with over 100 unique achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mischief is a joyful blend of teamwork, rivalry, and chaos—a local multiplayer adventure that’s easy to pick up and impossible to put down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of brave, mischievous rats in Mischief, the full action-adventure experience from Tavern Rat Studios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant neighborhood from a rat’s-eye view as you scurry, scamper, and scheme your way through creative co-op challenges, zany minigames, and unforgettable boss battles. Designed for couch co-op chaos and heartfelt fun, Mischief reimagines classic multiplayer adventures for a new generation.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/04c6ee4257e47efdfeb87ad82574712e.poster.avif?t=1755194545\" width=600 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/04c6ee4257e47efdfeb87ad82574712e.webm?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/04c6ee4257e47efdfeb87ad82574712e.mp4?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> Chaotic Co-op Adventures</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to four local players and dive into an imaginative world brimming with charm and challenge.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against larger-than-life household bosses like Shovul, Scourge of the Sandbox and Oscar, Pup of the Pit.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use everyday objects like crayons, ketchup, and surge protectors in clever ways to overcome obstacles and prank your foes. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/ef45457ec0ce530c23e02e0358e0c01b.poster.avif?t=1755194545\" width=600 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/ef45457ec0ce530c23e02e0358e0c01b.webm?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/ef45457ec0ce530c23e02e0358e0c01b.mp4?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> Competitive PvP Minigames</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break from teamwork and compete head-to-head in a variety of fast-paced minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your reflexes in a zany shooting gallery where precision is key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race your friends on chaotic, obstacle-filled rat tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outmaneuver rivals in a platforming showdown where only one rat can reign supreme.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more games to unlock and master!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/d7c90dbf5ec1416169c4018ab322b822.poster.avif?t=1755194545\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/d7c90dbf5ec1416169c4018ab322b822.webm?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/extras/d7c90dbf5ec1416169c4018ab322b822.mp4?t=1755194545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A <strong>World of Whimsy and Wonder</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore richly detailed environments built from everyday objects, viewed through the eyes of a rat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve co-op puzzles that require communication and creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and celebrate your wins with over 100 unique achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mischief is a joyful blend of teamwork, rivalry, and chaos—a local multiplayer adventure that’s easy to pick up and impossible to put down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Mischief is a delightful and imaginative action/adventure video game where you step into the paws of a courageous rat, navigating through a captivating world within the nooks and crannies of a typical home and a bustling backyard solo or with up to four local players!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/b2c454c9df707aea791cccd42e06bfda5415dadb/header.jpg?t=1755194545", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/4de2bf89f1679b1963b5644d0608531b33e6ee0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755194545", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844360/4de2bf89f1679b1963b5644d0608531b33e6ee0d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755194545", "website": "https://tavernratstudios.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core I5 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 530 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><